  "details": "Material swaps/animations are not working correctly on quest client. The exact same animation setup works perfectly fine on PC but doesn't work for quest users.\nI literally duplicated the project and the animations are not working on quest.\nExample:\nMake a material swap animation where the material is the standard material on keyframe 1 and the swapping material on keyframe 2. Using write defaults OFF. When toggling the material swap the swap is successful. When toggling the material swap OFF the swap is unsuccessful. The animation setup in the FX Layer has the animation in reverse(-1 speed) when the parameter is toggled to state \"false\".\nTrue -> Play material Animation Swap.\nFalse -> Play material Animation Swap in reverse.",
